J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Ryan</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Singh</surname><given-names>B.</given-names></name><name><surname>Kostic</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Microbiome interconnectedness throughout environments with major consequences for healthy people and a healthy planet</article-title><source>Microbiol. Mol. Biol. Rev.</source><year>2023</year><object-id pub-id-type="publisher-id">e0021222</object-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal" id="sref11"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bengtsson-Palme</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Boulund</surname><given-names>F.</given-names></name><name><surname>Fick</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Kristiansson</surname><given-names>E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Larsson</surname><given-names>D.G.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Shotgun metagenomics reveals a wide array of antibiotic resistance genes and mobile elements in a polluted lake in India</article-title><source>Front. Microbiol.</source><volume>5</volume><year>2014</year><fpage>648</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">25520706</pub-id>
